                                                "sense_id": "a51f3e0c-a918-3d77-937f-a1c0c84b2ca5",
                                                "text": "He called curtains on his double decade cricket career on Tuesday."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "3c273dda-382a-440a-b2c5-44d5984b2d30",
                                                "sense_id": "a51f3e0c-a918-3d77-937f-a1c0c84b2ca5",
                                                "text": "\"What if a bunch of scuba divers nosed about here?\" / \"Curtains for them, when our side-scan sonar sees them.\""
